      "id": 1,
      "text": "Founded in spring 1882, Gladstone began as Green River Station, a settlement of about 150 pioneers from Ripon, Wisconsin drawn to the area's rich soils.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
